      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Founded in 1881, Naturita once served as the epicenter for uranium mining before shifting to year‑round outdoor recreation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://choosewestend.org/naturita-colorado/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Today Naturita offers some of the best year‑round outdoor activities, from hiking to fishing along the San Miguel River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://choosewestend.org/naturita-colorado/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Along Highway 90, the historic Bedrock Store in Naturita hosted scenes from the film Thelma & Louise.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naturita%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The San Miguel River flows northwest from Naturita, joining the Dolores River before reaching the Colorado River in Utah.",
